{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/extras/abccbab1a0d480644c458237f6703fb8.poster.avif?t=1767620318\" width=614 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/extras/abccbab1a0d480644c458237f6703fb8.webm?t=1767620318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/extras/abccbab1a0d480644c458237f6703fb8.mp4?t=1767620318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHANGE YOUR REALITY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your understanding of the world\u2019s physical limits. Place, shift, and rotate portals to change the gravity direction of objects and even yourself. Make clever use of portals to reach new places, and make every surface a floor! Use your Spirit Powers to further influence the world around you. Control the flow of time and rotate the forces of gravity to solve mind-bending environmental puzzles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/extras/f63be53d81dc3d6666cad36cbaea71c1.poster.avif?t=1767620318\" width=616 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/extras/f63be53d81dc3d6666cad36cbaea71c1.webm?t=1767620318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/extras/f63be53d81dc3d6666cad36cbaea71c1.mp4?t=1767620318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A COLORFUL SPIRIT WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Kiko, a curious girl stuck in a whimsical spirit world in trouble. Meet a colorful cast of characters that will challenge Kiko to see the world, and herself, from exciting new perspectives. As Kiko comes into her own and bonds with the Spirits, she will see beyond the limits of reality and find the means to save Nomori. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/extras/5635366265b0dea29be60f554f1b2d48.poster.avif?t=1767620318\" width=616 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/extras/5635366265b0dea29be60f554f1b2d48.webm?t=1767620318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/extras/5635366265b0dea29be60f554f1b2d48.mp4?t=1767620318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THINK OUTSIDE THE BOX</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore every corner of your surroundings\u2014the more you seek, the more you\u2019ll find. Combine your Spirit Powers to create new outcomes; play with gravity and timing in a physics-based world to reach new heights! There are lots of ways to solve puzzles and to look at the world around you. Don\u2019t be afraid to get creative\u2014perspective is everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/extras/3ac97bec512100bd22c858083b3098a7.poster.avif?t=1767620318\" width=616 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/extras/3ac97bec512100bd22c858083b3098a7.webm?t=1767620318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/extras/3ac97bec512100bd22c858083b3098a7.mp4?t=1767620318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SHIFTING SEASONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through all the seasons of Nomori! Explore four unique domains, each with its own environment, puzzle mechanics and cast of Spirits. Use Kiko\u2019s Spirit Powers to master every season, and to bridge the shattered islands of the Spirit World together. Backtrack through levels with new Spirit Powers to see and navigate them through a brand new lens.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2932680?t=1767620318","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767620318","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767620318","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767620318","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/extras/abccbab1a0d480644c458237f6703fb8.poster.avif?t=1767620318\" width=614 height=120 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/extras/abccbab1a0d480644c458237f6703fb8.webm?t=1767620318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/extras/abccbab1a0d480644c458237f6703fb8.mp4?t=1767620318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHANGE YOUR REALITY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge your understanding of the world\u2019s physical limits. Place, shift, and rotate portals to change the gravity direction of objects and even yourself. Make clever use of portals to reach new places, and make every surface a floor! Use your Spirit Powers to further influence the world around you. Control the flow of time and rotate the forces of gravity to solve mind-bending environmental puzzles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/extras/f63be53d81dc3d6666cad36cbaea71c1.poster.avif?t=1767620318\" width=616 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/extras/f63be53d81dc3d6666cad36cbaea71c1.webm?t=1767620318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/extras/f63be53d81dc3d6666cad36cbaea71c1.mp4?t=1767620318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A COLORFUL SPIRIT WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Kiko, a curious girl stuck in a whimsical spirit world in trouble. Meet a colorful cast of characters that will challenge Kiko to see the world, and herself, from exciting new perspectives. As Kiko comes into her own and bonds with the Spirits, she will see beyond the limits of reality and find the means to save Nomori. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/extras/5635366265b0dea29be60f554f1b2d48.poster.avif?t=1767620318\" width=616 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/extras/5635366265b0dea29be60f554f1b2d48.webm?t=1767620318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/extras/5635366265b0dea29be60f554f1b2d48.mp4?t=1767620318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THINK OUTSIDE THE BOX</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore every corner of your surroundings\u2014the more you seek, the more you\u2019ll find. Combine your Spirit Powers to create new outcomes; play with gravity and timing in a physics-based world to reach new heights! There are lots of ways to solve puzzles and to look at the world around you. Don\u2019t be afraid to get creative\u2014perspective is everything.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/extras/3ac97bec512100bd22c858083b3098a7.poster.avif?t=1767620318\" width=616 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/extras/3ac97bec512100bd22c858083b3098a7.webm?t=1767620318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/extras/3ac97bec512100bd22c858083b3098a7.mp4?t=1767620318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SHIFTING SEASONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel through all the seasons of Nomori! Explore four unique domains, each with its own environment, puzzle mechanics and cast of Spirits. Use Kiko\u2019s Spirit Powers to master every season, and to bridge the shattered islands of the Spirit World together. Backtrack through levels with new Spirit Powers to see and navigate them through a brand new lens.</p>","developers":["Enchanted Works"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2932680/header.jpg?t=1767620318","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_r